#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeViewText.py:141
msgid ""
"Please report this as a bug and include the files /var/log/dist-"
"upgrade/main.log and /var/log/dist-upgrade/apt.log in your report. The "
"upgrade has aborted.\n"
"Your original sources.list was saved in /etc/apt/sources.list.distUpgrade."
msgstr ""
"Лутфан, инро ҳамчун хато гузориш диҳед ва файлҳоро дар /var/log/dist-"
"upgrade/main.log ва /var/log/dist-upgrade/apt.log ба гузориши худ илова "
"кунед. Такмилдиҳӣ қатъ карда шуд.\n"
"Файли аслии \"sources.list\"-и шумо дар "
"\"/etc/apt/sources.list.distUpgrade\" захира карда шуд."

#: ../DistUpgrade/DistUpgradeViewText.py:165
msgid "Aborting"
msgstr "Қатъ шуда истодааст"

